WEBVTT

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:06.310
Be careful.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.400
You're defenseless in your sleep.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.740
You're attracted to a strong will.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.150
Please don't.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:17.470
You'd be sending me into a world of darkness, where I couldn't move my limbs.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:21.200
Figured anything out, Mr. Novice Detective?

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:27.080
Anyone who laughs at me should just go ahead and die!

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.130
No... Quon-san...

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:33.720
I can't...

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:35.800
die.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.850
How about I tear you apart the way you humans kill flowers?!

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:45.390
It's an interesting ability, but I suppose we'll wait for another time.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:51.830
If you meet the gardener at the Fantasium Garden,

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:54.620
then tell him that it's a very beautiful garden.

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:16.920
Which one?

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:17.940
A little higher...

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:18.840
That yellow one!

00:01:19.150 --> 00:01:20.560
Okay.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:22.780
Got it!

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:25.700
Onii-chan, you're awesome!

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:27.450
Congratulations.

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:28.170
Here.

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:29.350
Yay!

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:34.560
It's ugly, but it's cute too.

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:36.150
Thanks a lot, Onii-chan.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:40.450
You're really a kid, if that makes you happy.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:44.290
What the...

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:45.990
Crap!

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:46.670
Lisa!

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:49.230
Lisa! Lisa!

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:50.790
Onii-chan!

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:51.040
Lisa!

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:54.380
I can't breathe... Onii-chan!

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:55.420
Lisa!

00:01:59.030 --> 00:02:01.010
Lisa, where are you?

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:05.600
Onii-chan!

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:10.270
Lisa!

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:14.330
Were you dreaming?

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:17.260
I can tell by looking at the EEG.

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:20.780
I'd be interested to hear about your dream.

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:22.990
I was dreaming of my past.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:26.790
My parents and my sister from ten years ago were in it.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:29.540
You were dreaming about your family?

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:30.820
It's not unusual,

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:36.300
but I guess I shouldn't expect something special just because you're a cyborg.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.260
Not unusual...

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:40.920
I wonder if that's the right phrase to describe it.

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:46.310
Sheesh, another interruption.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:56.280
Chapter 3 「A Fantasy Relationship」

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:05.390
Tei is watching over the boy.

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:07.040
Quon is fighting the enemy.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:07.790
Where's Yuri?

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.500
Sorry I'm late.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:15.540
Is this the boy?

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:16.740
Please take him.

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:33.480
You monsters!

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.870
Stop!

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:51.580
Epsilon?

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.630
Epsilon's been deactivated!

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:58.370
What's the cause?

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.170
Checking as we speak.

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:03.380
Something happened, apparently, when he attempted to recover the target.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:13.850
Ow!

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.370
Be a little gentler!

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:18.590
Then it wouldn't be called treatment.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:20.190
This is for skipping out on training.

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:24.400
If you hadn't messed up, I wouldn't have needed to do anything!

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:27.050
I'm grateful for what you did.

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:28.410
Thanks, Taka-bou.

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:31.290
You won't fool me with your shallow thank—

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.760
Ow! That hurts!

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.130
We can't see her right now.

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:43.110
Now, you should all go back to your rooms.

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:44.030
But...

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:46.130
Is Tei-san okay?

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:47.260
Yes.

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:49.600
Dr. Wakatsuki's checking up on her.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.600
What's she doing right now?

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:52.890
Can't we go inside and see?

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.720
Tei may not look it, but she's strong.

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:57.350
She'll be back and healthy before you know it.

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:02.640
So let's do our best not to make her worry before then.

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:04.870
I know, but...

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:06.700
Kiri-chan, please take care of the kids.

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:09.200
How's the boy you saved?

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:11.200
He's also doing fine.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:14.860
He must be exhausted from using his power.

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:16.210
He's sound asleep.

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:17.960
That's good.

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.820
Now, you should all go back to your rooms.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:23.710
We'll let you know as soon as Tei gets better.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:24.420
Okay.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.580
That's a promise!

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:26.770
Let's go.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:34.430
Dr. Wakatsuki, how's Tei?

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:37.780
I don't know why she's not waking up,

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:42.190
but judging by her EEG, she's in something like a dream state.

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:44.410
She's dreaming?

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:48.210
Yes, I can identify a pattern resembling PGO waves.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:52.830
They stimulate the hippocampus and cause people to dream.

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:55.080
What about his physical functionality?

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:57.970
The data doesn't show any abnormalities.

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:00.380
I wonder what exactly happened at the scene.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:01.930
Alpha.

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:02.750
Sir.

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:08.280
16:46, we confirm target BF463's larva burst.

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:10.300
We were dispatched as soon as the location was pinpointed.

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:12.890
17:03, we arrive on scene.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:19.770
17:06, we attempt to recover the target and become involved in a fight with Insania.

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:24.960
At that time, Epsilon is fighting as backup.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.530
Allow me to replay Epsilon's data.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:40.140
Epsilon switches over to recovering BF463 plus two others,

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:43.510
and then he freezes at the moment of contact.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:45.960
What will happen if he continues in this state?

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:50.470
Well, if he remains asleep like this...

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:53.130
...it's basically the same as brain death.

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:56.110
Eventually, she'd die from malnutrition.

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:56.970
No...

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:04.250
Where am I?

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:06.480
What?

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:09.990
Oh, I need to find that boy.

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:13.430
What is this?

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.480
I'm coming!

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:18.160
I'll save you!

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:28.760
Tei!

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:30.720
What's happening?!

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:32.310
Midori-kun?

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:32.880
What's wrong?!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.820
Her EEG's suddenly become unstable.

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:37.260
Her heart rate's increasing!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.430
Tei, stay strong!

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:41.270
Welfare Corportion
Nursing Home

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:49.570
No!

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:49.960
Yuri!

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:51.820
What's wrong?

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:56.930
No, stop...

00:07:56.930 --> 00:07:57.490
Yuri!

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:00.080
Get a grip! Yuri!

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:04.660
I...

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:06.420
You saw something?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.940
It wasn't that simple.

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:11.340
It felt like I was actually sent back to my childhood.

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:14.590
Is Tei's power going berserk?

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:16.060
Berserk?

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:17.600
What does that mean?

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:22.930
Tei can communicate telepathically using her power,

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:25.480
but she can also uncover people's pasts and emotions.

00:08:25.710 --> 00:08:30.110
If she wants to, she can amplify them and confuse them.

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:31.820
Then did she...

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:35.700
Tei...

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.870
His EEG has become unstable.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:42.760
His biological parts are at 40.6C.

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:45.290
It's possible they'll stop functioning.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.540
Any way to avoid that?

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:52.760
Erasing his memory and formatting his data might do the trick.

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:54.840
Then do it.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:57.810
But that would destroy his personality.

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:03.480
If that happened, he'd lose the advantages of being a cyborg and be a mere android.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:07.730
I think you'll be able to gather the new data you've always sought.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:10.160
Very well.

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.730
I'll prepare for formatting.

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:24.230
Preparations complete.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:26.960
Initiating format.

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:34.630
What's going on?

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:37.620
Her EEG's becoming unstable again.

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.510
But it's a different pattern this time.

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:43.270
Hold her down!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.270
Damn it!

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:48.090
Canceling format!

00:09:48.090 --> 00:09:49.100
What's going on?

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:53.780
I've identified a wave pattern belonging to a third person.

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:58.150
He seems to have synchronized with Epsilon's EEG pattern somehow.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:00.660
What are you saying?

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:03.620
Analyzing the wave pattern as we speak.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.770
I've found a match!

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:08.620
The larva's pattern is the controlling mind.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.150
I see!

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:14.550
One of the targets Epsilon came in contact with is interfering with his brain.

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:22.790
It's hard to believe, but Epsilon appears to be telepathically linked with one of the targets.

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:24.260
That would mean...

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:27.430
Can you trace the link?

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.810
Technologically, it's possible.

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:34.690
But it involves much higher risk than that formatting.

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:38.030
In the worst case, Epsilon might never...

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:43.090
If we can trace the link, we can locate their hideout.

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:44.970
That includes Insania.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.500
Doesn't this sound like the perfect chance?

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.500
Then what about him?

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:53.250
He'll be a small sacrifice for the greater good.

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:55.020
Roger.

00:10:55.490 --> 00:10:57.510
Attempting to trace the link.

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.260
Beginning trace.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:07.270
I hope that your last dream is about your family, at least.

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:10.200
What?!

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:10.560
What's going on?

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:12.520
What is it now?

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:15.120
Ryo, what's going on?

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:17.400
The med room's console is behaving strangely.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:23.520
Someone on the outside is trying to infiltrate through Tei's EEG.

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:29.790
It's highly possible that her power burst has linked her telepathically with one of them.

00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:31.460
What?

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:37.880
At this rate, it's only a matter of time until we're discovered.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.720
As I thought.

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:44.070
They're using very complex routing.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:47.830
Tech division, can you finish the tracing process?

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:48.560
Roger.

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:51.800
10% tracing rate...

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:53.220
They're fast.

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:55.280
Why are they so fast?

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:58.940
Dr. Wakatsuki, can you cut Tei off from the medical system?

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:00.920
I can't right now!

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:04.320
If I do that, she'll die in less than a minute!

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:06.350
I see.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:09.540
Then I'll somehow try to buy us some time.

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.360
Ryo, sorry, and thanks.

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:21.130
We're being interrupted.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:23.970
I'm not surprised that they discovered our intrusion.

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:26.970
Find a way to keep going.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:28.260
Roger.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.710
Ryo made these?

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:34.480
They're dummy chips that imitate Tei's EEG pattern.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:42.780
I could only prepare 40 of them, but I'm also setting up fakes at access points around the world.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:46.780
The more places they have to find, the more time we'll have...

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:49.740
but we'll still be discovered eventually.

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:54.370
I asked all my animal friends, but there are still 23 chips left.

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:56.490
Leave it to me.

00:12:56.490 --> 00:12:58.510
I'll go scatter the rest.

00:12:58.510 --> 00:12:59.420
I'll help as well.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:02.120
I can do this alone.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:04.840
You figure out a way to wake Tei up.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.510
I'll go help buy us time.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.050
Yuri...

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:09.470
I can't help, you know!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:11.280
I know!

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:13.520
Your job isn't to use your power multiple times.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:17.680
But you'd better do the best you can when it really counts!

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:18.560
Miu, let's go.

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.190
Yeah!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:24.480
Well, if you really want me to, I could take one.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:26.790
Oh no!

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:28.660
She's become unstable again.

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:31.030
Quon?

00:13:36.510 --> 00:13:37.390
What's up?

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:38.590
It's this boy.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.040
I can feel it.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:46.300
I hear his faint voice from time to time, mixed in with Tei's consciousness.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:49.800
Then, is he also connected to Tei?

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:55.970
Tei probably chose to remain in her mental world in order to save this boy.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:14:01.820
If that's the case, perhaps I can talk to her through him.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:06.030
But your mental ability isn't very high.

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.820
If you mess up, you could join them!

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:10.620
You know I have to do this, Seiji.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:13.950
You can only regenerate physical wounds!

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:15.620
Not the wounds in your heart!

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:17.820
Still...

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:19.870
I want to protect everyone.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.710
Tei, and this boy.

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:27.440
To do that, I have to...

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:32.270
Quon...

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:35.890
Take care of everyone for a while.

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.540
Okay.

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:40.520
Do be careful.

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:03.360
Well then...

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:04.790
Time to wreak some havoc!

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:10.450
New relay points detected on the map.

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:11.930
Estimated tracing time has changed.

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:14.640
So that's their plan.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:18.090
They're trying to confuse us.

00:15:18.090 --> 00:15:22.910
They're scattering fake signal sources around the globe.

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:28.220
We'll need to check each one of them to locate their hideout.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.150
Larva signals detected.

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:33.840
Fifteen signals detected in district 23,

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:35.670
all at the same time.

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:38.200
Transferring authority to the information division.

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:40.330
Activating surveillance protocol.

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:42.500
Initiating surveillance of the target.

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:50.550
Boy, am I a hard worker.

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:00.100
No, I'll never forgive you.

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:02.310
Where are you? Come out!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:08.650
Tei!

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.840
Okay, which one next?

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.320
Um...

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:14.740
Tei!

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:18.470
Tei, it's me.

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:19.540
Can't you tell?

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:21.790
Who are you?

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:22.750
What do you want with Lisa?

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:25.500
Tei, who is he?

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.450
Who the hell are you?

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:29.910
This is my sister, Lisa.

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:31.300
She's not Tei!

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:33.250
I see.

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:34.890
This is his memory.

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:38.300
Tei, you're being consumed by his memory.

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:39.980
Remember yourself!

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:45.440
You unleashed your power in order to save that boy.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:51.940
And now, for some reason, you've become trapped in his memory.

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:57.410
Both the physical you and the boy are in critical condition.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.120
You can't stay here any longer.

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:02.730
Get out right now!

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:04.330
Everyone's in danger!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:05.430
Tei!

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:06.900
I...

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:07.810
I...

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:09.290
Enough of that!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:13.300
I've already told you that her name isn't Tei!

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:16.420
If you keep spouting nonsense, I'll teach you a lesson!

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:16.760
O-Onii-chan!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:22.540
What?!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:25.440
Wh-Who are you?

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:27.400
Lisa, no!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.700
This isn't... This isn't...

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:29.970
Tei, get away!

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:32.150
You're trapped inside his memory!

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:33.570
No!

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:36.860
Lisa! Lisa!

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:38.780
Damn it! What did you do to Lisa?

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.470
You surprised me.

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:43.740
I thought you were all just chunks of metal,

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:45.750
but I guess you have memories too.

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:48.200
This isn't the real me.

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:49.770
Who are you?

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:51.250
Where did you send Lisa?!

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:54.260
This is just a fantasy you've created.

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:56.640
Enough of your lies!

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:59.120
I'm not handing my sister to anyone!

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:00.310
I'll get Lisa—

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:03.510
I won't let any bad guys live!

00:18:08.300 --> 00:18:10.520
What in the...

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:23.470
Yeah, I'll get rid of the bad guys.

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:26.580
I'll be a superhero.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:30.670
You're...

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:34.790
W-Wait!

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:37.170
Nii-san. Nii-san!

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:44.140
Nii-san, wake up!

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.860
Nii-san!

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:48.640
Towa.

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:53.560
Sheesh, Towa. What took so long?

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:55.830
I ended up falling asleep.

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:59.060
I didn't have any trouble finding the herbs,

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:00.530
and look at what I found on the rocks.

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:03.480
What's that flimsy thing?

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:05.860
It's rock tripe.

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:08.120
It only grows on rocky cliffs.

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:11.750
It takes hundreds of years to get this big.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:14.710
Really? You're so smart.

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:20.170
Everyone knows about this, and that Granny Chiyo loves it.

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:22.380
Granny Chiyo, huh...

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:25.010
All I get from her are boring lectures.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:29.310
She's worried because you're not trying to improve your power.

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:35.060
I don't need power to get by.

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:38.880
Well, it's a lot better than using it for something bad.

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:43.270
Now, let's go back and help get the festival ready, or we'll—

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:46.120
What was that?

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:51.050
Oh no, we need to save him.

00:19:51.050 --> 00:19:52.330
Be careful.

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:53.900
He might be from the village.

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.290
That doesn't matter!

00:19:56.050 --> 00:19:56.630
Towa!

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:05.810
What a terrible injury...

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:07.930
Towa, he's from the village!

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:11.230
A-A demon!

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:15.730
Please, I'll give you what I've caught, so spare me!

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:20.410
I'm not a demon or a ghost.

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:22.830
I'm just going to take a look at your injury.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:24.570
Stay still.

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:28.800
It's broken.

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:35.080
Now, can you pray hard for the pain in your leg to go away and for it to be healed?

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:39.920
Just wish from the bottom of your heart for your leg to be healed.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.580
I'm sure it'll get better.

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:45.910
Hey! Don't tell me you plan to use your power.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:46.860
Hush!

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:48.680
Now, please trust me.

00:20:59.630 --> 00:21:00.520
Towa...

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:06.620
It's all better.

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:14.990
Th-Thank you very much.

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:19.090
The road back down the mountain is steep, so be careful.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:29.100
Hey, why did you use your power on a villager?

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:32.130
You know it's against the tribal rules.

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:38.180
I just wanted to save someone in trouble.

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:42.080
One of these days, I'm sure we'll stop caring about all that stuff.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:44.320
I'm sure of it.

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:45.850
Towa...

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:50.680
Now, we'll get in trouble if we don't hurry. Let's go.

00:21:54.740 --> 00:21:56.200
This conversation...

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:58.260
I've had this before.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:03.770
Wh-What's going on?

00:22:09.290 --> 00:22:12.910
One of the larva signals matches our records.

00:22:12.910 --> 00:22:16.680
It's BFS02, who works alongside Insania.

00:22:16.990 --> 00:22:21.870
Their jamming system appears to be in effect, and we can't locate her larva signal.

00:22:21.870 --> 00:22:25.690
Dispatching operation teams A through F for invasion.

00:22:25.690 --> 00:22:29.240
It's an obvious move on their part to buy time.

00:22:29.710 --> 00:22:33.200
Let's deploy the teams to lure out Insania.

00:22:37.720 --> 00:22:40.420
Quon, take care of Tei.

00:22:47.930 --> 00:22:48.900
Ryo.

00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:51.220
I've confirmed it on my side as well.

00:22:51.220 --> 00:22:54.050
The organization is close to locking in on Yuri.

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:57.000
That idiot.

00:22:57.000 --> 00:22:58.230
What about their infiltration of the system?

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:01.870
So long as the dummy chips are in effect, we'll manage.

00:23:02.270 --> 00:23:04.110
The signal from number 16 disappeared?

00:23:04.770 --> 00:23:06.860
And 31! 6!

00:23:08.010 --> 00:23:11.920
Are they destroying the dummy chips one by one?

00:23:29.200 --> 00:23:30.330
A cat?

00:23:30.330 --> 00:23:32.070
The signal's around here.

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:33.460
Leave no stone unturned.

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:38.860
How's it going?

00:23:38.860 --> 00:23:40.680
No problems so far.

00:23:41.220 --> 00:23:46.190
His personality is disappearing, as I feared.

00:23:48.190 --> 00:23:50.380
They've already destroyed six of them.

00:23:50.870 --> 00:23:52.980
If we don't disconnect as soon as possible,

00:23:52.980 --> 00:23:54.820
they'll pinpoint our location.

00:23:59.360 --> 00:24:01.670
Quon. Quon!

00:24:03.980 --> 00:24:07.840
If the elders find out you're slacking off again, they'll give you another lecture.

00:24:10.680 --> 00:24:13.340
Oh, you already got the festival pendant?

00:24:15.450 --> 00:24:19.720
Anyway! The adults are getting ready to worship the holy tree.

00:24:29.020 --> 00:24:30.810
I know it's a little late to say this,

00:24:30.810 --> 00:24:33.030
but do they really need so many people?

00:24:33.030 --> 00:24:35.960
Why don't they just use their power to do that?

00:24:35.960 --> 00:24:38.500
It's against the rules to use it outside the festival.

00:24:38.500 --> 00:24:41.160
You can only use it during the power exhibitions.

00:24:41.160 --> 00:24:44.090
Geez, I know that.

00:24:44.090 --> 00:24:44.800
Still...

00:24:44.800 --> 00:24:47.540
people won't always think that way.

00:24:47.540 --> 00:24:48.850
Look at this!

00:24:49.470 --> 00:24:51.630
See, you're doing great!

00:24:51.630 --> 00:24:54.820
I can do it really well when I'm around you.

00:24:56.870 --> 00:24:57.990
I did it!

00:24:57.990 --> 00:24:58.850
I did it, Towa!

00:24:59.300 --> 00:25:00.670
Good job, guys.

00:25:00.670 --> 00:25:03.510
At that rate, you'll do just fine during the exhibition.

00:25:04.600 --> 00:25:05.850
Now then...

00:25:06.330 --> 00:25:08.360
Nii-san, shall we get going?

00:25:09.380 --> 00:25:10.820
Go? Go where?

00:25:11.070 --> 00:25:12.540
You forgot?

00:25:12.540 --> 00:25:14.780
You promised we'd go herb picking.

00:25:15.720 --> 00:25:18.620
No, didn't we already...

00:25:23.140 --> 00:25:24.370
I'll get rid of you.

00:25:29.950 --> 00:25:30.500
Who are...

00:25:32.460 --> 00:25:35.330
Wait, could this...

00:25:35.330 --> 00:25:36.870
Could this world be...

00:25:40.250 --> 00:25:42.980
We'll get nowhere if we just go on like this.

00:25:42.980 --> 00:25:43.850
How are things at your end?

00:25:43.850 --> 00:25:46.350
They're all back already.

00:25:45.530 --> 00:25:46.350
I see.

00:25:47.180 --> 00:25:49.360
Then we're just depending on Yuri.

00:25:53.430 --> 00:25:54.780
Dr. Wakatsuki.

00:25:55.630 --> 00:25:57.610
How long will she stay like this?

00:25:57.610 --> 00:26:03.080
If Tei's power is responsible for her current state, as Ryo-kun suggested,

00:26:03.080 --> 00:26:06.330
trying to solve this medically will turn out badly.

00:26:06.670 --> 00:26:10.360
Then all we can do is just stand around and wait?!

00:26:10.360 --> 00:26:12.920
Well, Quon is our only hope.

00:26:16.030 --> 00:26:17.060
Wait!

00:26:17.060 --> 00:26:19.510
Nii-san. Nii-san!

00:26:24.480 --> 00:26:26.480
Nii-san, wake up!

00:26:26.480 --> 00:26:28.130
Nii-san!

00:26:29.990 --> 00:26:30.980
Towa...

00:26:31.960 --> 00:26:35.940
Sheesh, Towa. What took you so long?

00:26:35.940 --> 00:26:38.150
I ended up falling asleep.

00:26:38.880 --> 00:26:41.370
I didn't have any trouble finding the herbs,

00:26:41.370 --> 00:26:42.870
and look at what I found on the rocks.

00:26:44.020 --> 00:26:45.930
What's that flimsy thing?

00:26:46.580 --> 00:26:48.320
It's rock tripe.

00:26:48.320 --> 00:26:50.460
It only grows on rocky cliffs.

00:26:50.980 --> 00:26:54.090
It takes hundreds of years to get this big.

00:26:54.240 --> 00:26:57.050
Really? You're so smart.

00:26:58.320 --> 00:27:02.390
Everyone knows about this, and that Granny Chiyo loves it.

00:27:03.180 --> 00:27:05.060
Didn't we already...

00:27:06.560 --> 00:27:07.770
What's gotten into you all of a sudden?

00:27:07.770 --> 00:27:10.280
We've had this conversation before.

00:27:10.280 --> 00:27:12.030
This isn't reality!

00:27:14.990 --> 00:27:15.910
It's him!

00:27:15.910 --> 00:27:16.730
Look! Right there!

00:27:16.080 --> 00:27:16.730
Nii-san!

00:27:17.600 --> 00:27:20.030
Stop! Tell me what's going on!

00:27:22.680 --> 00:27:26.110
That was a memory of the distant past.

00:27:26.110 --> 00:27:29.660
But it felt like I was just living it.

00:27:30.760 --> 00:27:34.130
Was Yuri reacting to the same phenomenon?

00:27:34.330 --> 00:27:37.580
Then Tei... and that cyborg too...

00:27:37.930 --> 00:27:39.070
I get it!

00:27:39.070 --> 00:27:41.090
This world isn't... It's...

00:27:41.890 --> 00:27:43.200
Tei! Where are you?!

00:27:43.200 --> 00:27:45.010
You can't stay here!

00:27:45.930 --> 00:27:47.220
I'll kill you.

00:27:47.220 --> 00:27:49.560
I'll get rid of all the bad guys.

00:28:05.620 --> 00:28:06.950
Onii-chan, thanks!

00:28:06.950 --> 00:28:10.580
You're really a kid, if that makes you happy.

00:28:10.580 --> 00:28:12.980
You're not current with the times, Onii-chan.

00:28:12.980 --> 00:28:14.440
That's why no girls—

00:28:17.090 --> 00:28:18.840
Who are you?

00:28:18.840 --> 00:28:20.420
I haven't seen you around.

00:28:20.420 --> 00:28:21.590
Which school are you from?

00:28:21.840 --> 00:28:25.840
At first, I thought this was a fantasy world you'd created.

00:28:25.840 --> 00:28:30.600
But I just came back from my own past.

00:28:31.320 --> 00:28:34.580
This is a fantasy which that boy has fabricated.

00:28:34.580 --> 00:28:37.610
You and Tei are trapped within that world.

00:28:37.940 --> 00:28:40.260
Remember who you really are.

00:28:40.260 --> 00:28:42.360
You can't stay here any longer!

00:28:42.360 --> 00:28:45.450
What's his problem? He's crazy.

00:28:45.450 --> 00:28:46.860
Lisa, let's go.

00:28:46.860 --> 00:28:47.950
Y-Yeah.

00:28:47.950 --> 00:28:48.530
Tei!

00:28:50.640 --> 00:28:51.250
Lisa?

00:28:51.980 --> 00:28:53.180
I...

00:28:53.600 --> 00:28:54.380
I...

00:28:54.380 --> 00:28:55.920
Don't get in the way.

00:28:56.110 --> 00:28:57.710
Don't get in the way!

00:28:58.830 --> 00:28:59.930
What?

00:29:11.700 --> 00:29:13.500
Just one more.

00:29:14.480 --> 00:29:15.810
Oops.

00:29:17.320 --> 00:29:18.480
What's the situation?

00:29:18.480 --> 00:29:21.780
I hate to tell you this when you're doing a good job,

00:29:21.780 --> 00:29:23.740
but they're destroying the chips one after another.

00:29:23.740 --> 00:29:25.530
How are Tei and Quon doing?

00:29:25.530 --> 00:29:27.430
No progress yet.

00:29:28.720 --> 00:29:30.040
Then...

00:29:30.040 --> 00:29:32.700
I guess I have to buy us even more time.

00:29:33.290 --> 00:29:34.790
Yuri, what are you trying to pull?!

00:29:35.800 --> 00:29:39.350
A moving target will buy us more time.

00:29:39.350 --> 00:29:41.110
Stop! It's too dangerous!

00:29:41.110 --> 00:29:43.490
You're already being tracked!

00:29:43.490 --> 00:29:46.170
Geez, thanks for believing in me.

00:29:46.170 --> 00:29:48.930
You should know I'm good at running away.

00:29:49.560 --> 00:29:51.530
Yuri. Yuri!

00:29:51.530 --> 00:29:53.410
That idiot...

00:29:55.230 --> 00:29:56.980
Under Construction
Thank you for your cooperation

00:30:06.110 --> 00:30:09.360
Target BFS02 heading northeast.

00:30:09.360 --> 00:30:12.450
An access point is also moving with the target.

00:30:12.800 --> 00:30:15.080
So childish.

00:30:22.160 --> 00:30:23.730
God, I'm tired.

00:30:25.600 --> 00:30:26.840
I guess this is the best I can do.

00:30:37.880 --> 00:30:39.180
Taka-bou!

00:30:40.480 --> 00:30:42.360
You came for me?

00:30:43.390 --> 00:30:45.000
Let me tell you...

00:30:45.000 --> 00:30:47.150
I'm not doing this just once.

00:30:47.150 --> 00:30:51.220
I have to do it twice to go back.

00:30:52.680 --> 00:30:54.820
Taka-bou! Taka-bou!

00:30:54.820 --> 00:30:58.190
Goodness, what did you come here to do?

00:31:03.630 --> 00:31:06.470
New larva signal detected in the Shinagawa district.

00:31:06.470 --> 00:31:09.170
It's moving with BFS02.

00:31:10.390 --> 00:31:16.190
Insania's more likely to show himself if two of his friends are in danger.

00:31:16.880 --> 00:31:18.680
Send out the WTOC.

00:31:41.470 --> 00:31:43.040
Any contact from those two?

00:31:43.040 --> 00:31:44.460
It looks like something happened.

00:31:44.740 --> 00:31:48.510
They're both headed toward the protected greenfield land near Shinagawa station.

00:31:48.510 --> 00:31:49.830
I see.

00:31:49.830 --> 00:31:51.280
How are the dummies doing?

00:31:51.280 --> 00:31:52.900
21 left.

00:31:52.900 --> 00:31:53.780
I see.

00:31:55.800 --> 00:31:56.950
It's me.

00:31:56.950 --> 00:31:57.870
Yes.

00:31:58.370 --> 00:32:00.520
I know this is sudden, but...

00:32:08.860 --> 00:32:10.570
Y-You're...

00:32:12.430 --> 00:32:13.290
Why?

00:33:38.870 --> 00:33:39.870
Oh no!

00:33:42.240 --> 00:33:42.880
Miu!

00:33:42.880 --> 00:33:43.770
Miu!

00:33:43.770 --> 00:33:44.910
Keep it together!

00:33:44.910 --> 00:33:46.210
What happened?

00:33:46.210 --> 00:33:48.850
It was only for an instant, but I saw Quon.

00:33:48.850 --> 00:33:51.710
I saw Quon consumed with rage.

00:33:52.020 --> 00:33:53.300
What?

00:33:55.230 --> 00:33:57.220
Is he connected with Tei?

00:34:00.100 --> 00:34:02.470
What... was that?

00:34:04.480 --> 00:34:05.920
Oh no...

00:34:05.920 --> 00:34:07.190
Quon...

00:34:09.780 --> 00:34:11.170
Shit!

00:34:11.170 --> 00:34:13.520
Yuri and Takao are surrounded?

00:34:13.520 --> 00:34:14.480
And the dummies?

00:34:14.960 --> 00:34:16.180
18 left.

00:34:20.450 --> 00:34:21.490
Quon...

00:34:40.510 --> 00:34:42.790
So you are Insania!

00:34:45.030 --> 00:34:46.520
Quon-sama...

00:34:47.010 --> 00:34:49.040
What the hell did you guys do?

00:34:49.530 --> 00:34:51.780
We didn't do anything, really.

00:34:52.290 --> 00:34:59.030
Tei's desire to protect, and your hatred, linked with the boy.

00:34:59.030 --> 00:35:01.710
That caused him to wander into the darkness in his heart.

00:35:04.420 --> 00:35:06.800
We won't let you take him!

00:35:06.800 --> 00:35:07.910
I'll kill you.

00:35:08.090 --> 00:35:09.270
Who is that?

00:35:09.750 --> 00:35:12.250
Where are you? Where did you go?

00:35:12.250 --> 00:35:14.250
I'll get rid of the bad guys.

00:35:14.250 --> 00:35:14.840
Over there?

00:35:14.840 --> 00:35:16.280
I'm coming!

00:35:16.840 --> 00:35:17.710
Wait!

00:35:29.270 --> 00:35:30.810
Where did you hide it?

00:35:30.980 --> 00:35:32.730
I know there are some left!

00:35:32.730 --> 00:35:33.610
Stop!

00:35:33.610 --> 00:35:34.770
He'll wake up!

00:35:34.770 --> 00:35:35.990
Why?

00:35:35.990 --> 00:35:38.530
You promised we'd go to the festival!

00:35:38.580 --> 00:35:41.730
Don't worry, I just tripped and fell.

00:35:45.260 --> 00:35:48.830
I'll become a superhero!

00:35:49.970 --> 00:35:54.130
I'll get stronger and get rid of the bad guys!

00:35:54.360 --> 00:35:56.580
So this is all your fault!

00:35:57.050 --> 00:36:02.510
I... never even got to touch my family.

00:36:02.510 --> 00:36:03.970
Or even talk to them.

00:36:05.430 --> 00:36:07.810
She reads people's minds.

00:36:07.810 --> 00:36:11.730
Everyone hated me, and I was always alone.

00:36:07.810 --> 00:36:09.140
That's just sick.

00:36:11.730 --> 00:36:13.230
She's a monster!

00:36:13.230 --> 00:36:16.400
I'd only heard the sound of festivals. I'd never seen one.

00:36:17.260 --> 00:36:21.920
But you showed me what a festival was.

00:36:21.920 --> 00:36:23.240
It was fun.

00:36:23.880 --> 00:36:27.810
Truly strong people don't think about defeating someone.

00:36:27.810 --> 00:36:31.000
They think about saving the weak.

00:36:31.450 --> 00:36:33.860
But... I...

00:36:33.860 --> 00:36:35.700
Don't worry.

00:36:35.700 --> 00:36:37.460
We'll also help.

00:36:38.050 --> 00:36:41.260
I... I...

00:36:41.560 --> 00:36:44.120
Let's try to be strong together.

00:36:44.540 --> 00:36:46.220
You'll have a lot of friends too.

00:36:54.710 --> 00:36:56.480
You won't have your way.

00:36:57.020 --> 00:36:59.550
I won't allow you monsters to—

00:36:59.550 --> 00:37:01.670
You still haven't realized?

00:37:01.670 --> 00:37:02.360
Realized what?

00:37:02.660 --> 00:37:04.280
I found out...

00:37:04.280 --> 00:37:07.270
when I synchronized with your sister.

00:37:07.270 --> 00:37:10.370
You were locking your past away.

00:37:10.370 --> 00:37:12.990
Wh-What are you saying?

00:37:12.990 --> 00:37:14.750
Stop talking crap!

00:37:15.080 --> 00:37:19.740
No matter how cruel the past, it can never be changed.

00:37:19.740 --> 00:37:20.250
Shut up!

00:37:20.610 --> 00:37:26.660
I volunteered for this body to get rid of monsters like you!

00:37:26.660 --> 00:37:28.170
The past doesn't...

00:37:34.150 --> 00:37:35.290
Stop!

00:37:35.290 --> 00:37:36.140
Onii-chan!

00:37:38.080 --> 00:37:39.690
Help me...

00:37:40.730 --> 00:37:42.070
Onii-chan...

00:37:42.290 --> 00:37:43.780
Lisa! Lisa!

00:37:51.930 --> 00:37:55.270
Help me... Onii-chan!

00:37:58.750 --> 00:37:59.900
It's hot!

00:37:59.900 --> 00:38:01.800
It's hot, Onii-chan!

00:38:05.430 --> 00:38:06.700
No...

00:38:06.700 --> 00:38:10.780
No! Onii...

00:38:14.690 --> 00:38:17.850
Lisa... I...

00:38:25.630 --> 00:38:28.280
Y-You're back?

00:38:31.300 --> 00:38:33.260
Epsilon has woken up.

00:38:33.260 --> 00:38:35.620
As a result, we're disconnected.

00:38:35.620 --> 00:38:37.870
We failed to locate their hideout.

00:38:39.830 --> 00:38:41.750
What about the larva bait?

00:38:42.080 --> 00:38:44.700
We're closing in on them,

00:38:44.700 --> 00:38:48.070
but the target has the upper hand in terms of speed.

00:38:48.070 --> 00:38:50.760
Get all the operations teams on their tail.

00:38:51.620 --> 00:38:53.870
We're done destroying the dummies.

00:38:53.870 --> 00:38:57.440
As of now, capturing Insania is the highest priority.

00:38:57.440 --> 00:38:58.140
Roger.

00:38:58.700 --> 00:39:02.150
I hope you won't fail to entertain me.

00:39:08.000 --> 00:39:09.700
It looks like the dummies no longer matter.

00:39:10.430 --> 00:39:12.430
You're okay now.

00:39:12.430 --> 00:39:14.460
I'm sorry I caused so much trouble.

00:39:17.500 --> 00:39:18.500
How's Yuri?

00:39:18.770 --> 00:39:20.790
I've already taken care of it.

00:39:20.790 --> 00:39:22.630
You don't need to worry.

00:39:22.630 --> 00:39:26.990
So she's in danger.

00:39:27.520 --> 00:39:28.520
Quon.

00:39:28.520 --> 00:39:30.490
You should already know.

00:39:30.490 --> 00:39:32.140
You can't stop me.

00:39:33.280 --> 00:39:34.890
You never change.

00:39:43.940 --> 00:39:45.900
I'm out of breath.

00:39:53.400 --> 00:39:54.370
We're doomed.

00:39:58.080 --> 00:39:58.870
Quon!

00:39:59.350 --> 00:40:00.620
Get Takao out of here now!

00:40:00.960 --> 00:40:01.840
But...

00:40:01.840 --> 00:40:02.680
Now!

00:40:09.990 --> 00:40:10.930
Quon!

00:40:26.070 --> 00:40:28.860
I won't... ever go through that again.

00:40:29.480 --> 00:40:30.690
I have to...

00:40:32.520 --> 00:40:35.670
I have to... protect everyone!

00:40:48.510 --> 00:40:50.630
Beta, Gamma, and Delta are damaged.

00:40:57.260 --> 00:40:59.140
A desperate struggle.

00:41:01.790 --> 00:41:02.930
What?

00:41:03.440 --> 00:41:06.930
Explosion detected inside the enclosed area.

00:41:06.930 --> 00:41:10.190
It appears there was an accident in one of the mid-construction facilities.

00:41:10.400 --> 00:41:11.750
An accident?

00:41:11.750 --> 00:41:13.610
Are you sure it wasn't intentional?

00:41:13.920 --> 00:41:16.470
The investigation team is checking the cause.

00:41:16.470 --> 00:41:18.700
The operations team's cordon was set perfectly.

00:41:18.970 --> 00:41:22.620
Firefighters and police in the jurisdiction are headed for the scene.

00:41:22.620 --> 00:41:24.710
We don't have time to conceal the incident.

00:41:25.130 --> 00:41:31.710
Only someone on the inside could pull off a stunt like this. And...

00:41:32.060 --> 00:41:33.290
I see.

00:41:33.290 --> 00:41:36.190
Sorry for the trouble. Thanks.

00:41:38.740 --> 00:41:41.720
I'm glad there was no permanent damage.

00:41:42.740 --> 00:41:44.230
I'm sorry.

00:41:45.480 --> 00:41:47.810
I'm just glad you understood.

00:41:49.280 --> 00:41:50.410
Thank you.

00:41:52.440 --> 00:41:56.370
It seems they got roughed up badly, yet again.

00:41:56.370 --> 00:41:58.950
Sorry, but I'll have to check on you later.

00:42:09.730 --> 00:42:11.170
Did you see it too?

00:42:11.170 --> 00:42:12.180
Yeah.

00:42:12.180 --> 00:42:13.730
Was that real?

00:42:13.730 --> 00:42:15.380
It definitely felt real!

00:42:15.580 --> 00:42:16.980
It was scary.

00:42:37.640 --> 00:42:38.660
Yuuma.

00:42:44.840 --> 00:42:47.540
Quon, did you kill people?

00:42:56.490 --> 00:42:59.300
Yes, I did.

00:43:12.440 --> 00:43:17.490
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:43:17.490 --> 00:43:25.700
A scream of my burning soul that seems to burst out of my chest

00:43:17.490 --> 00:43:25.490
mune no oku hajike sou na atsui tamashii no sakebi wo

00:43:25.700 --> 00:43:32.250
Burst on the fire

00:43:45.970 --> 00:43:51.100
I was struck by thunderstorm, suddenly awakening my instinct

00:43:45.970 --> 00:43:51.100
raiu ni utare totsuzen mezameta honnou

00:43:51.100 --> 00:43:55.650
It burns on, pushing aside my sensibility

00:43:51.100 --> 00:43:55.650
risei wo oshinokete moetagiru no sa

00:43:55.650 --> 00:44:00.740
The truth is written on the walls of memory

00:43:55.650 --> 00:44:00.740
kioku no kabe ni kakikomareta shinjitsu wa

00:44:00.740 --> 00:44:05.070
No one can violate it

00:44:00.740 --> 00:44:04.950
dare ni mo okasenai

00:44:05.070 --> 00:44:14.500
We have no questions; we just want to break the structure of this world with our hands

00:44:05.200 --> 00:44:14.460
gimon nante nai kono sekai no shikumi wo buchikowashichimae so no te de

00:44:14.500 --> 00:44:24.680
Clear up the fate that befalls me, and then run to the future! Get on!

00:44:14.500 --> 00:44:24.680
furikakaru sadame kirihiraki ima mirai e kakenukero! Get on!

00:44:24.680 --> 00:44:29.560
Feel Rock emotion! Burning Rock emotion!

00:44:29.560 --> 00:44:34.100
With an unknown power second to none,
I will change the direction of the wind

00:44:29.560 --> 00:44:34.100
